  s0: No execution running
  s1: Launch: create request sent
  s2: Pending row with no pane
  s3: Pending row with no pane, an unrecorded pane runs Claude
  s4: Launch: pane made, not recorded yet
  s5: Launch: pane recorded, Claude being checked
  s6: Pane recorded, Claude not proven
  s7: Launched, not bound yet
  s8: Bound, Claude running
  s9: Prompt checked, about to be sent
  s10: Pane closed, row not retired yet
  s11: Bound, Claude exited, shell left in the pane
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a turn starts a launch
  s1 --> s2: the server crashes and restarts or the create reply is lost
  s1 --> s3: the server crashes and restarts or the create reply is lost
  s1 --> s0: the create request never leaves
  s1 --> s4: Herdr answers with the new pane
  s2 --> s2: the server boots, reconcile only reads
  s4 --> s3: the server crashes and restarts or recording the pane fails
  s4 --> s5: the pane is recorded
  s5 --> s6: the server crashes and restarts or Claude is not found in the pane
  s5 --> s7: Claude is confirmed in the pane
  s7 --> s8: the first prompt binds the execution
  s8 --> s9: the input gate checks Claude in the pane
  s8 --> s10: an operator terminates the pane
  s8 --> s11: Claude exits
  s6 --> s7: a later turn confirms Claude
  s7 --> s0: the ended execution's row is retired
  s6 --> s0: the ended execution's row is retired
  s9 --> s8: the server crashes and restarts or the prompt is sent
  s9 --> s9: Claude exits
  s10 --> s0: the row is retired or the ended execution's row is retired
  s11 --> s0: the ended execution's row is retired
  s11 --> s10: an operator terminates the pane
  s9 --> s11: the server crashes and restarts or the prompt is sent
